# NOTE: the following are deliberately NOT ignored, because CI regenerates them
# and fails if the committed version differs (see Makefile target `check-generated`):
#
#   backend/go.sum
#   frontend/package-lock.json
#   auth/package-lock.json
#   backend/internal/api/api.gen.go      (generated from openapi/openapi.yaml)
#   frontend/src/generated/api.ts        (generated from openapi/openapi.yaml)
#
# If these are not in git, the drift check cannot prove the contract and the code
# still match. Do not add them here.
